{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rR6Xacqp1mS1AsvwFELvMw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:53.805058+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rR6Xacqp1mS1AsvwFELvMw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/lyPYjbCQW8ekb8lvIHiciaGABxMlhOj2dEotyMqGFbO8FibyicVSDyNHxfrYD4ysWnKViadEMqsTluO5EksIJrXSd5g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>第七届优秀大学生</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>暑期夏令营</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/LUX0u6RFr6fnOk9Gl9KM1ia96rzAAvUEPFl7HxoX2Npucf78zRiafgNwjj8MiahDVRoL7FDNtRQImSN2d4dJVicibbQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/enUf10XOwjElFTVf3n2XJSPhPo8YcVYF7RjSOxcNSOibiawv5VatMrV8IQYMQLic70FzBQCoKIAowJtVFqlOiapQmg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>浙江大学爱丁堡大学联合学院（ZJE）依托浙江大学基础医学、生物学学科与爱丁堡大学生物医学学科，</span><span><strong><span>面向未来生命健康，聚焦前沿基础研究、疾病诊断、基于人工智能的药物开发领域，</span></strong></span><span><span>以“全人培养、全球浸染、全链实践”</span></span><span>为理念培养生物医学复合型拔尖创新型人才。学院于2018启动第一届双学位博士项目招生，2020年启动浙江大学硕士项目，2021年启动首届爱丁堡大学单学位博士、硕士生项目，目前全院在读研究生200多人。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span>学院将于7月中旬举办2025年第七届优秀大学生暑期夏令营。根据学院研究生教育培养方向，夏令营将依托细胞精细结构信号传导中心、再生医学与干细胞治疗研究生中心、生物医学系统与信息学中心、感染免疫和癌症中心、生物医学与工程转化中心五大研究中心开展学术交流活动，</span><span><strong><span>涉及病原生物学、干细胞和再生医学、免疫学、生物化学与分子生物学、细胞生物学、生物信息学、生物医学</span></strong></span><span>等专业领域。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/lyPYjbCQW8ekb8lvIHiciaGABxMlhOj2dEHtyg836zPTmltBLd1ibHSibiaibcjUdO2TIyAEtvnI7JoI6o1Fy9I9qaibA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/mqM18TLKCiaRWUq6WX3SLSWeibuQMSlV8A4kU1PWRMuP0LsHVofIwX8c4tokBL11qPt7jYHa1G6XNRuRkJbKJ4Ww/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>01</span></span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>特色项目</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>除一般硕博士研究生项目外，学院还开设以下特色项目：</span></p></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>1.双学位博士项目：联合培养 双重名校学籍</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span>融合浙江大学基础医学（第五轮学科评估中获评A类学科）叠加生物医学专业发源地爱丁堡大学的培养特色，学院将二次遴选优秀学生进入双学位博士培养项目，注册两校学籍，共享两校资源，顺利毕业后将分别获得两校学位证书。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/lyPYjbCQW8ekb8lvIHiciaGABxMlhOj2dEibqtX66YN6nCiaEbaRmdQkbZwEorzNOAalGykreiaIiafBF66cSlkyIkRQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/lyPYjbCQW8ekb8lvIHiciaGABxMlhOj2dEcrjica77WlSVVD2Ow4en5ArYmzEiazRgic8lGClDNj5awt0EkAJ7q7o7g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>2.外方单学位硕博项目</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span>全程在浙江大学海宁国际校区培养；采用申请制招录，无需参加全国研究生招生考试，招录学生学术水平符合爱丁堡大学要求；达到毕业要求者颁发爱丁堡大学硕士、博士学位，学位证书获教育部认证。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>国际化博导队伍 多研究生培养模式</span></strong></p><p><span><span>浙大海归师资和爱大优质师资组成导师组共同培养博士生，外籍师资占比60%。目前学院包含：浙江大学硕士项目、浙江大学博士项目、爱丁堡大学博士项目、浙江大学爱丁堡大学双学位博士项目。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院导师信息：</span></span><span><span>https://zje.zju.edu.cn/ZJEFaculty/list.psp</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/lyPYjbCQW8ekb8lvIHiciaGABxMlhOj2dEo5XekeBUxdVKs8RPnOaDXibX0kphGFEGU88X4biaEA4vKMIsFiaP8nicSQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>人文培养，多实验室轮转</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>学生入学后可以选择在自己感兴趣的导师实验室轮转交流，感受导师实验室研究方向，最终确定合适的导师。</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>02</span></span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学费标准</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>浙江大学博士项目</span></span></strong><span><span>10000元/年</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>浙江大学爱丁堡大学双</span></span><span><span>学位博士项</span></span><span><span>目</span></span></strong><span><span> </span></span><span><span>10000元/年</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>浙江大学硕士项目</span></span></strong><span><span>8000元/年</span></span></p><p><span><span>以上学费、招生方式按照浙江大学研究生项目标准。（统考、推免、申请-考核招生）同等享受浙江大学各种评奖评优，岗位助学金，因公派出科研、联合培养等，联合学院提供助教岗位津贴，每学期每门课满岗工作津贴8000元。</span></span></p><p><span><span> </span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>外方（爱丁堡大学）单学位硕士项目</span></span></strong><span><span>180000元/年（一年制），外方（爱丁堡大学）单学位博士项目</span></span><span><span>200000元/年（四年制），全程国内培养，毕业后获得爱丁堡大学硕士/博士学位。</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>03</span></span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><span>1、欢迎全国具有</span><span><strong><span>生物医学、生物医学工程、生物信息学、生物学、药学、动物科学、基础医学等</span></strong></span><span>相近学科背景，鼓励具有工程和计算机知识背景且对交叉学科有浓厚兴趣的2026届本科生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.品学兼优，具有较强或潜在的科研能力，预期可以获得所在学校推免资格的学生（外方单学位项目学生不需要推免资格）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.英语成绩良好，</span><span><strong><span>国家英语六级水平考试460分以上或TOEFL80分以上或雅思5.5分以上</span></strong></span><span>成绩者优先考虑。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>04</span></span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>报名方式</span></b></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>登录浙江大学研究生招生服务系统，下拉框中选择“夏令营申请系统”，弹出页面中选择登录（首次登录需先点击注册按钮，注册账号），登录成功后填写相应信息提交即可。）</span></p><p><span>https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span><span>报名时间：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>2025 年6月1日至6月<span>28日（</span></span><span><span>含</span></span><span><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>报名系统备注：</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/lyPYjbCQW8ekb8lvIHiciaGABxMlhOj2dEf5S3rzDfzqzvO9CaQFRiaViaQxUPx27nCoRraBVfub4aIl0HJ45JmicgQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>同时提供以下材料电子版：</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>（1）本科阶段成绩单，加盖教务部门公章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）学校或院系出具的成绩排名证明，加盖教务部门或院系公章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）英语水平的证明材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）其他重要证明材料包括能体现自身学术水平的学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果、获奖证书等材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>*上述材料压缩为ZIP文件（不超过10M）后，在网申系统的“成绩单附件及证明材料”中上传。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>05</span></span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>录取方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span>由学院择优录取，7月初入选者也将收到邮件或电话通知且需在规定日期前确认是否参营，逾期未确认视为放弃资格，未入选者不另行通知。暑期夏令营日程安排待后续通知。入营学生，学院承担在校区食宿，交通费用自理。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>06</span></span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><span>浙江大学国际联合学院（海宁校区）</span></span></p><p><span><span>浙江大学爱丁堡大学联合学院朱老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：zhuzhu@intl.zju.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>电话：0571-87572315</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>往届精彩回顾</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/lyPYjbCQW8ekb8lvIHiciaGABxMlhOj2dEcjoI1zswRmys39iam6pPWeOv8jaTDVS7bZ4icsVgb4ElmHF5NBNPbEnA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/lyPYjbCQW8ekb8lvIHiciaGABxMlhOj2dE5f4H1aBkeTDa44leMJzKjzL1Bbia4WNuIickMMiciayf5Af8QsncYn8IbA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/lyPYjbCQW8ekb8lvIHiciaGABxMlhOj2dE7tFicJ3lX7fx9yYZibPL8rx1VDUrFdFLwlthaONxIgiaH1e3Xj3LcGgqg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/lyPYjbCQW8ekb8lvIHiciaGABxMlhOj2dEYbc2LR5ibddicVrKJicobAUyDt0HwLcuEKeNT5yHYWROEywFUicdsn41CQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>图文｜ZJE研究生教务团队</span></p><p><span>编辑｜喻娇</span></p><p><span>责任编辑｜黄晓涵</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>推荐阅读</span></p></section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/J8DicJrUc04cWzS